{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 25, "ref": "1-kings 20:25", "book": "1-kings", "lang": "ff", "chapter": 20, "translation": "Aa, limo ngam ⟨את⟩ maaɗa konu hono konu ngo yani ⟨את⟩ maaɗa, puccu hono puccu e karossaaje hono karossaaje; men mbaɗa hare e maɓɓe to palaasoo — hãkame min ɓurataa ɓe semmbe. O nanii daande maɓɓe, o waɗi ko non.", "tokens": [{"surface": "ואתה", "gloss": "aa"}, {"surface": "תמנה", "gloss": "limo"}, {"surface": "לך", "gloss": "ngam maaɗa"}, {"surface": "חיל", "gloss": "konu"}, {"surface": "כחיל", "gloss": "hono konu"}, {"surface": "הנפל", "gloss": "ngo yani"}, {"surface": "מאותך", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ maaɗa"}, {"surface": "וסוס", "gloss": "puccu"}, {"surface": "כסוס", "gloss": "hono puccu"}, {"surface": "ורכב", "gloss": "karossaaje"}, {"surface": "כרכב", "gloss": "hono karossaaje"}, {"surface": "ונלחמה", "gloss": "men mbaɗa hare"}, {"surface": "אותם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "ɓe (Arameeɓe)"}, {"surface": "במישור", "gloss": "to palaasoo"}, {"surface": "אם", "gloss": "hãy"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "wanaa"}, {"surface": "נחזק", "gloss": "ɓurataa semmbe"}, {"surface": "מהם", "gloss": "ɓe"}, {"surface": "וישמע", "gloss": "o nanii"}, {"surface": "לקלם", "gloss": "daande maɓɓe"}, {"surface": "ויעש", "gloss": "o waɗi"}, {"surface": "כן", "gloss": "ko non"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-14T07:25:08.154922238Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}